	DAWNCREST_GUIDE_SUMMARY = "Dawncrests are coins to upgrade your gear. You earn them from Delves, dungeons, raids, and outdoor events.|n|nSpend them at Cuzoth in Silvermoon. Trade lower crests at Vaskarn when you outgrow a track.|n|n«…of the Dawn» achievements give 50%% upgrade discount for your whole Warband. Each color has a weekly cap (~100). Extra lower crests can help your alts.",
